  entries:
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_01
    Value: Morninggg.
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_02
    Value: "Morning, babe. You\u2019re up?"
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_03
    Value: Umm...
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_04
    Value: "I\u2019m still sleepy."
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_05
    Value: But you have work today.
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_06
    Value: "I\u2019m too lazy... I just wanna sleep all day."
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_07
    Value: Hahaha. To get you motivated, I already made your favorite spicy fried
      rice.
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_08
    Value: "Come on, let\u2019s have breakfast first. Then get ready for work."
  - Key: CH2_Breakfast1_09
    Value: Hmm... okay.
